# Authors

g6shim is written by gookie and its contributors, listed below with the GitHub names they use.

Parts of g6shim are ported from other projects licensed under the GPL-3.0-or-later. The people who wrote that code hold the copyright to it and are listed by area.

## Contributors

- gookie
- AX200M

